    "preamble": "Pravin S/O. Sanjay Zawar vs The State Of Maharashtra on 10 October, 2019 Author: V.K.Jadhav Bench: V.K.Jadhav 1 5-ABA.1149-19.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 5 Anticipatory Bail Application No.1149 Of 2019 Pravin S/O. Sanjay Zawar Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Mr. Bharuka D.S., Advocate for Applicant. Mr. V.S.Badakh, App for Respondent-State. ... Coram : V.K.Jadhav, J. Date : 10.10.2019",
    "facts": "On perusal of the same, it appears that the Godown, which is the subject matter of the present crime, has been given on rent from 29.06.2018 for near about 14 months to co-accused Arjun Aglave. The learned APP seeks time to verify the said original rent agreement and also direct the Investigating Officer to record the statement of the witnesses on the rent agreement.",
